# Segments to a port nothing listens on draw a RST (RFC 9293 3.10.7.1):
# without ACK, <SEQ=0><ACK=SEG.SEQ+SEG.LEN><CTL=RST,ACK>;
# with ACK, <SEQ=SEG.ACK><CTL=RST>. A RST itself is never answered.
stack_port 8080
0      < S 0:0(0) win 65535
+0     > R. 0:0(0) ack 1 win 0
+0.010 < . 100:110(10) ack 5000 win 65535
+0     > R 5000:5000(0) win 0
+0.010 < R 1:1(0) win 0
